message: If you use this repository, please cite it using these metadata.
title: "新的生命形态与成体生长理论：化学视角 (Chemical Perspectives on New Life Forms and Adult Growth Theory)"
abstract: >
  Theory-first stochastic models of chemical signals and living tissue
  states. The current project snapshot contains a formal model specification
  (v0.1) targeting mouse intestinal epithelium, with no executable
  simulation yet. The repository is a research plan / early-stage
  prototype, not a validated biological prediction tool.
